  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=a196c95766d74c57b618ebdb291492f5",
  "detail_text": "THIS IS A SOLE SOURCE SYNOPSIS. ACC-RSA has a Sole Source Requirement for SirsiDynix Core Renewal. This is a Sole Source with SirsiDynix Core, IAW FAR 16.505(b)(2)(i)(B). IAW FAR 16.505(b)(2)(i)(B), Sirsi Corporation is the only source capable of fulfilling the Government's requirement for SirsiDynix Core. This provides yearly maintenance services for the proprietary copyrighted software. No Solicitation documents exist at this time. This item utilizes North American Industry Classification System (NAICS) Code of 513210. IAW FAR 5.207(c)(16_(ii) all responsible sources may submit a capability statement, proposal, or quotation, which shall be considered by the agency. This provides essential services required by the customer in a classified environment. ACC-RSA will not be responsible for any costs incurred by the interested parties in responding to this notice. This notice of intent is not a request for competitive quotes. Phone calls will not be accepted.",
